r suspected terrorists a day coming  across our border and we have to be able  to stop this and we need Democrats to  sit down with us at the table and get  the job done Sarah this week a second  child died in the custody of Border  Patrol what is the administration doing  to improve conditions we spoke to the  Commissioner of CBP who said conditions  are not fit for children how are you  guaranteeing that children will be safe  and why did it take the death of a  second child to make major changes look  it it's absolutely a terrible tragedy  something no one wants to see which is  also why we're encouraging people not to  make this treacherous journey it is  dangerous this is one of the most  important reasons that we have to  protect our border so that we're not  incentivizing people to make this  dangerous journey and that they come  through the legal and correct process so  that we don't have these types of  instances we're doing everything we can  to make sure that when these people show  up most of them incredibly dehydrated  haven't eaten that we're giving them the  best care that we can a lot of these  individuals  children and adults are seen doctors for  the very first time in their lives and  that's through the CBP team and through  Department of Homeland Security we want  to do everything we can to protect life  but at the same time this is the exact  reason that we want people to come  through the legal process and not make  this treacherous journey a third of the  women that come through this journey are  rape or sexually assaulted and these are  horrific things that nobody wants to see  happen that's why we have to close up  loopholes that's why we have to break it  illegal and that's why Democrats need to  sit down and help us Sarah the legal  process that you're encouraging though  is is unrealistic it's taking people  years to get through the asylum process  so what are you doing quickly if you can  to haste in that process well that's  exactly one